# Cloudflare Pages redirects and rewrites
#
# Static rules come first, then the ones with a placeholder or a splat: Pages
# resolves exact paths faster when nothing dynamic is above them.

# ── The app's routes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Each client route is rewritten to the app shell with a 200. Anything NOT
# listed falls through to dist/404.html — the same shell, served with a 404
# status and `noindex` (build/prerenderMeta.ts), where the router draws its
# not-found page. So a mistyped URL is a real 404 instead of a copy of the
# homepage, and a missing JS chunk after a deploy is a 404 instead of HTML.
#
# ADD EVERY NEW ROUTE HERE. One forgotten still renders — 404.html boots the
# app — but crawlers and link scrapers get a 404 for it.
# src/router/staticRoutes.spec.ts fails when a router path isn't covered.
#
# The target is `/`, never `/index.html`. Pages strips `/index.html` to `/`
# with a 308, so a rewrite to it redirects the visitor to the homepage — or,
# for a splat, is rejected at deploy as an infinite loop and ignored. The old
# `/* /index.html 200` catch-all was ignored that way: deep links only worked
# because Pages serves index.html for unknown paths when there is no 404.html.
#
# Not listed, because a file answers them first: `/` (index.html) and the
# prerendered cards /partners, /partners/apply, /partners/templates and
# /privacy (build/prerenderMeta.ts). /events/<id> itself goes to the Function
# in functions/events/[id].ts before this file is read.

/home                              /  200
/about                             /  200
/contact                           /  200
/signin                            /  200
/signup                            /  200
/events                            /  200
/explore                           /  200
/services                          /  200
/calendars                         /  200
/settings                          /  200
/security                          /  200
/credits                           /  200
/my-tickets                        /  200
/admin                             /  200
/template-showcase-preview-frame   /  200

